<title>UK: Hanson hotel lease sold to Copthorne.</title>
<headline>Hanson hotel lease sold to Copthorne.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millennium and Copthorne Hotels Plc said on Tuesday it had bought the long-term leasehold of the Copthorne Plymouth hotel in south-west England from Hanson Plc's hotel unit HB Hotels Ltd.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said it had paid 4.1 million stg for the leasehold. Millennium and Copthorne has run the hotel on a management contract since it opened in 1987.</p>
<p>London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
